                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick NC Lin",
                        "email": "patrick.nc.lin.wiwynn@gmail.com",
                        "username": "PatrickLinww"
                    },
                    "message": "Thanks for pointing that out. I'll revise the implementation in the next version to properly use the phosphor-state-manager interface and fix the whitespace error."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-yosemite4/recipes-phosphor/dbus/phosphor-dbus-monitor/fan-rotor-fail-mechanism",
