                        "username": "PatrickLinww"
                    },
                    "message": "Hi @patrick@stwcx.xyz, Thanks for pointing this out. I\u2019ve updated the implementation to follow your suggestion and now use the phosphor-state-manager call instead of the systemd call. Please help to review it again."
                },
